@HandilyCommerce.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
# Keep in sync with Api:Version in appsettings.json (default v1).
@ApiVersion = v1
@ApiRoutePrefix = api

### Health check
GET {{HandilyCommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/{{ApiRoutePrefix}}/{{ApiVersion}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Ping / version
GET {{HandilyCommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/{{ApiRoutePrefix}}/{{ApiVersion}}/ping
Accept: application/json

###

### API version (FE footer)
GET {{HandilyCommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/{{ApiRoutePrefix}}/{{ApiVersion}}/apiVersion
Accept: application/json

###

### Changelog (What's new)
GET {{HandilyCommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/{{ApiRoutePrefix}}/{{ApiVersion}}/changelog
Accept: application/json

###
